<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 22.86 pct, 3-mo 22.51 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 22.86 pct, 3-mo 22.51 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rate (BUBOR) rose for both the one-month and three-month maturities, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said on Friday.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was fixed at 22.86 percent, up from 22.75 percent, and the three-month rate at 22.51 percent, up from 22.43 percent, the NBH said.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom, +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
